label story_05_complete (The Door Beneath Veld Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): The door beneath Veld has answered. I felt the Devourer pressing its name through the stone.
"Dianthus Core": There is no lesser herald between us and that hunger. The path bends straight toward the bloom or the breach.
"Dianthus Core": My pollen is no longer only a blessing. It is a key, a blade-edge, and the last seed of my hidden strength.
"Dianthus Core": Harvest it when the light steadies. Forge something worthy of the final bloom.
